[2026-03-14T20:17:36.216Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YVm43QVfEy6Zo8chbese9B","type":"tool_result","content":"   315→\n   316→#### Test: Pagination controls are displayed when results exceed one page\n   317→- **Initial state:** User is on the home page. More properties exist than can fit on one page (e.g., more than the page limit of 12 or 20 properties).\n   318→- **Expected:** Pagination controls are displayed below the property grid showing page numbers (e.g., \"1 2 3 ... 5\"), a \"Previous\" button (disabled on first page), and a \"Next\" button.\n   319→\n   320→#### Test: Pagination controls are hidden when all results fit on one page\n   321→- **Initial state:** User is on the home page. Fewer properties exist than the page limit.\n   322→- **Expected:** No pagination controls are displayed below the property grid.\n   323→\n   324→#### Test: Clicking Next page loads the next set of properties\n   325→- **Initial state:** User is on the home page viewing page 1 of results. Multiple pages of properties exist.\n   326→- **Action:** User clicks the \"Next\" button.\n   327→- **Expected:** The property grid updates to show the second page of properties. The URL or API call includes `page=2`. The current page indicator highlights \"2\". The \"Previous\" button becomes enabled.\n   328→\n   329→#### Test: Clicking Previous page loads the previous set of properties\n   330→- **Initial state:** User is on page 2 of property results.\n   331→- **Action:** User clicks the \"Previous\" button.\n   332→- **Expected:** The property grid updates to show the first page of properties. The current page indicator highlights \"1\". The \"Previous\" button becomes disabled again.\n   333→\n   334→#### Test: Clicking a specific page number navigates to that page\n   335→- **Initial state:** User is on page 1 of results. At least 3 pages of properties exist.\n   336→- **Action:** User clicks page number \"3\".\n   337→- **Expected:** The property grid updates to show the third page of properties. The current page indicator highlights \"3\".\n   338→\n   339→#### Test: Next button is disabled on the last page\n   340→- **Initial state:** User is on the last page of property results.\n   341→- **Expected:** The \"Next\" button is disabled/grayed out and not clickable. The \"Previous\" button is enabled.\n   342→\n   343→#### Test: Previous button is disabled on the first page\n   344→- **Initial state:** User is on page 1 of property results.\n   345→- **Expected:** The \"Previous\" button is disabled/grayed out and not clickable. The \"Next\" button is enabled (if more than one page exists).\n   346→\n   347→#### Test: Applying filters resets pagination to page 1\n   348→- **Initial state:** User is on page 3 of property results.\n   349→- **Action:** User applies a category filter by clicking the \"Cabin\" chip.\n   350→- **Expected:** The pagination resets to page 1. The property grid shows the first page of filtered results. The page indicator highlights \"1\".\n   351→\n   352→#### Test: Pagination is functional on repeated use\n   353→- **Initial state:** User is on page 1 of results with multiple pages available.\n   354→- **Action:** User clicks \"Next\" (goes to page 2), then clicks \"Next\" again (page 3), then clicks \"Previous\" (back to page 2), then clicks page \"1\" (back to page 1).\n   355→- **Expected:** Each navigation correctly updates the property grid and page indicator. The final state shows page 1 results.\n   356→\n   357→## Page: Property Detail (`/properties/:id`)\n   358→\n   359→<!-- Components: ImageGallery, PropertyHeader, PropertyInfo, PropertyDescription, AmenitiesList, BookingCard, ReviewsSection, HostInfoCard -->"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FLUvQRzTj8MMmeZak2tShv","session_id":"7bb5263e-5376-4969-a996-fe1b348ef266","uuid":"f2fcbfe1-bb74-4030-b64d-096763e816a4"}
